{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/css/bem/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>CSS 방법론에는 OOCSS, BEM, SMACSS 등이 있습니다. 그 중 BEM 방식!!</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-bem의-기본-구조\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. BEM의 기본 구조<a href=\"#1-bem%EC%9D%98-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"1 bem의 기본 구조 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>BEM은 Block, Element, Modifier를 뜻한다. 이 세 가지로 구성된 이름을 짓는 것을 말한다. 그리고 각각 __ 와 – 로 구분한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.header__navigation--navi-test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n\t<span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> red<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>위 코드에서 header는 Block, navigation은 Element, navi-text는 Modifier가 된다.</p>\n<p>BEM은 기본적으로 ID를 사용하지 않으며, class만을 사용한다.<br>\n또 ‘어떻게 보이는가’가 아니라 ’<strong>어떤 목적인가</strong>‘에 따라 이름을 짓는다. 예를 들어, 에러 메시지를 띄우는 P 태그에게는 .red가 아닌, .error 라는 이름을 줘야 한다.<br>\n이름을 연결할 때는 block-name과 같이 하이픈 하나만 써서 연결한다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-block-element-modifier\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. Block, Element, Modifier<a href=\"#2-block-element-modifier\" aria-label=\"2 block element modifier permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"21-block\" style=\"position:relative;\">2.1 Block<a href=\"#21-block\" aria-label=\"21 block permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>독립적인 페이지 컴포넌트. =>  똑 떼어다가 어딘가에 쓸 수 있는 단위</li>\n<li>재사용이 가능하다.</li>\n<li>독립적인 형태</li>\n</ul>\n<p>예를 들어, 아래 이미지의 Logo 블럭은 어딘가에 종속되지 않는다. 헤더에 쓰일 수도 있고, 푸터에 쓰일 수도 있고, 여기저기 붙였다 떼었다 할 수 있다. 이렇게 재사용할 수 있는 요소를 블럭이라 한다.</p>\n<p>또, 블럭은 블럭을 감쌀 수 있다. .header > .logo 는 header라는 블럭 안에 logo라는 블럭이 들어간 형태이다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/0d9d4/bem-01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 51.5625%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/a59e9/bem-01.webp 192w,\n/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/0ca9f/bem-01.webp 384w,\n/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/dc9b9/bem-01.webp 768w,\n/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/54bff/bem-01.webp 993w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/3b721/bem-01.png 192w,\n/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/66595/bem-01.png 384w,\n/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/fe486/bem-01.png 768w,\n/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/0d9d4/bem-01.png 993w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/2dbae1133e5f25dece0f804f1bddbdaa/fe486/bem-01.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"22-element\" style=\"position:relative;\">2.2 Element<a href=\"#22-element\" aria-label=\"22 element permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>블럭을 구성하는 단위이다.</li>\n<li>블럭은 독립적인 형태인 반면, 엘리먼트는 의존적인 형태.</li>\n<li>자신이 속한 블럭 내에서만 의미를 가지기 때문에 블럭 안에서 떼어다 다른데 쓸 수 없다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 547px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/25257/bem-02.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 60.9375%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/a59e9/bem-02.webp 192w,\n/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/0ca9f/bem-02.webp 384w,\n/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/98f86/bem-02.webp 547w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 547px) 100vw, 547px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/3b721/bem-02.png 192w,\n/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/66595/bem-02.png 384w,\n/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/25257/bem-02.png 547w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 547px) 100vw, 547px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/2c19bfbe45f0e1089679e127995d63e0/25257/bem-02.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>form</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>input</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__input<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>button</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__button<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>Search<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>button</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>form</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>위 예시에서 .search-form은 블럭이고, .search-form__input과 .search-form__button은 엘리먼트다.<br>\n저 search-form 이란 블럭은 떼어내서 요기조기 마음껏 붙여도 된다.<br>\n하지만 내부의 input고 button은 검색을 위한 인풋창이자 버튼이기 때문에, search-form 안에서만 존재 의미가 있는 엘리먼트다.</p>\n<p>엘리먼트 또한 중첩이 가능하다. ex) .block > .block__element1 > .block__element2</p>\n<p>BEM의 재미있는 점은, .block_element2 를 .block_element1 의 하위 엘리먼트로 보지 않고 둘 다 똑같이 .block 의 엘리먼트로 취급한다.<br>\n그래서 클래스 내임에 캐스캐이딩을 여러번 표시할 필요가 없다.</p>\n<p>따라서 BEM은 아래와 같이 사용하지 않는다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token comment\">&lt;!-- 이렇게 사용하지 않는다 --></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>form</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>div</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__content<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>input</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__content__input<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>button</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__content__button<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>Search<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>button</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>div</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>form</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>위 형태는 block-name__element-name 이란 형식을 따르고 있지 않다. 대신에 아래와 같이 사용한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-html line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>form</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>div</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__content<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>input</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__input<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>button</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">class</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>search-form__button<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>Search<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>button</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>div</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\r\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>form</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"23-modifier\" style=\"position:relative;\">2.3 Modifier<a href=\"#23-modifier\" aria-label=\"23 modifier permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>모디파이어는 블럭이나 엘리먼트의 속성을 담당한다.<br>\n생긴게 조금 다르거나, 다르게 동작하는 블럭이나 엘리먼트를 만들 때 사용한다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/22121/bem-03.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 64.0625%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/a59e9/bem-03.webp 192w,\n/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/0ca9f/bem-03.webp 384w,\n/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/dc9b9/bem-03.webp 768w,\n/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/0a256/bem-03.webp 947w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/3b721/bem-03.png 192w,\n/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/66595/bem-03.png 384w,\n/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/fe486/bem-03.png 768w,\n/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/22121/bem-03.png 947w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/1d7527e570da6cac097af356a17bef4c/fe486/bem-03.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n